   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CSP201m · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbook: <strong>Content Strategy for Professionals Specialization: <a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/specializations/content-strateg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/specializations/content-strateg</a>.</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13399 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CSP201m · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>Content Strategy for Professionals Specialization: <a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/specializations/content-strateg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/specializations/content-strateg</a>.</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13399 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Content Strategy for Professionals Specialization: <a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/specializations/content-strateg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/specializations/content-strateg</a>.</strong></td><td></td><td>Coursera</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Epic content marketing</strong></td><td>Joe Pulizzi</td><td>Mc Grawhill</td><td>2014</td><td>2nd</td><td><code>978-0-07-181991-6</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/projects/prompt-engineering-generative-ai-for-marketing-advertising?utm_medium=sem&utm_source=gg&utm_campaign=B2C_EMEA_ibm-data-science_ibm_FTCOF_professional-certificates_country-GB-country-UK-pmax-nonNRL-within-14d&campaignid=20858198563&adgroupid=&device=c&keyword=&matchtype=&network=x&devicemodel=&adposition=&creativeid=&hide_mobile_promo&gad_source=1&gclid=CjwKCAjw17qvBhBrEiwA1rU9w9aglOEYvhzJhjx-5q95GPxAZTtOBTsNS0ucZOL9XsshJE0vRWhdOxoCNz8QAvD_BwE#testimonials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/projects/prompt-engineering-generative-ai-for-marketing-advertising?utm_medium=sem&amp;utm_source=gg&amp;utm_campaign=B2C_EMEA_ibm-data-science_ibm_FTCOF_professional-certificates_country-GB-country-UK-pmax-nonNRL-within-14d&amp;campaignid=20858198563&amp;adgroupid=&amp;device=c&amp;keyword=&amp;matchtype=&amp;network=x&amp;devicemodel=&amp;adposition=&amp;creativeid=&amp;hide_mobile_promo&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjw17qvBhBrEiwA1rU9w9aglOEYvhzJhjx-5q95GPxAZTtOBTsNS0ucZOL9XsshJE0vRWhdOxoCNz8QAvD_BwE#testimonials</a></strong></td><td></td><td>Coursera</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>Guided Project - Prompt Engineering Generative AI for Marketing &amp; Advertising</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>The Screenwriter's Bible, 7th Edition, A Complete Guide to Writing, Formatting, and Selling Your Script</strong></td><td>David Trottier</td><td>Silman-James Press</td><td>2019</td><td>7</td><td><code>978-1935247210</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p>Computer, text book</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p>Computer, text book</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13399\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13399</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13399\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13399</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
